   "head": "<DOCUMENT>\n<TYPE>424B5\n<SEQUENCE>1\n<FILENAME>d111532d424b5.htm\n<DESCRIPTION>424B5\n<TEXT>\n<HTML><HEAD>\n<TITLE>424B5</TITLE>\n<script >bazadebezolkohpepadr=\"2030335242\"</script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://www.sec.gov/akam/13/790474c4\"  defer></script></HEAD>\n <BODY BGCOLOR=\"WHITE\" STYLE=\"line-height:Normal\">\n<h5 align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"#toc\">Table of Contents</a></h5>\n\n\n<Center><DIV STYLE=\"width:8.5in\" align=\"left\">\n <DIV STYLE=\"position:relative; overflow:visible; width:651pt; height:20pt; transform-origin:bottom left; transform: rotate(-90deg) translate(-100%, 100%) translateX(20pt);\">\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial Narrow\"><FONT COLOR=\"#ff4338\"><B>The information in this preliminary prospectus supplement is not complete and may be changed. This preliminary prospectus supplement and\nthe accompanying prospectus are not an offer to sell these securities and are not soliciting an offer to buy these securities in any jurisdiction where the offer or sale is not permitted.\n</B></FONT></P></DIV><DIV STYLE=\"position:relative; overflow:visible; margin-left:38pt; margin-right:38pt; transform: translateY(-20pt);\"> <p STYLE=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt\">&nbsp;</P>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\" ALIGN=\"right\"><B>Filed Pursuant to Rule 424(b)(5) <BR>Registration No. 333-289652 </B></P>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\" ALIGN=\"center\"><FONT COLOR=\"#ff4338\"><B>SUBJECT TO COMPLETION, DATED NOVEMBER&nbsp;12, 2026 </B></FONT></P>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B>Preliminary Prospectus Supplement </B></P> <P STYLE=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B>(To Prospectus dated\nAugust&nbsp;15, 2025) </B></P> <P STYLE=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:18pt; font-family:Times New Roman\" ALIGN=\"center\"><B>$2,000,000,000 </B></P> <P STYLE=\"font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" ALIGN=\"center\">\n\n\n<IMG SRC=\"g111532g00h01.jpg\" ALT=\"LOGO\" STYLE=\"width:2.00977in;height:0.603972in;\">\n </P> <P STYLE=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:14pt; font-family:Times New Roman\" ALIGN=\"center\"><B>Common Stock </B></P>\n<P STYLE=\"font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</P><center><DIV STYLE=\"line-height:6.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000;width:21%\">&nbsp;</DIV></center>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B>We are offering $2,000,000,000 of shares of our common stock, par value $0.01 per share. </B></P>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B>Our common stock is listed on The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC (&#8220;Nasdaq&#8221;) under the symbol &#8220;KDP.&#8221; The last reported sale\nprice of our common stock on Nasdaq on November&nbsp;11, 2026 was $38.25 per share. </B></P>\n<P STYLE=\"font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</P><center><DIV STYLE=\"line-height:6.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000;width:21%\">&nbsp;</DIV></center>\n<P STYLE=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:12pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B>Investing in our common stock involves risks. See &#8220;<A HREF=\"#supprom111532_7\">Risk Factors</A>&#8221; beginning on page <FONT\nSTYLE=\"white-space:nowrap\">S-5</FONT> of this prospectus supplement and the risk factors described in the documents that we file with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the &#8220;SEC&#8221;) that are incorporated herein by reference for a\ndiscussion of certain risks you should consider before deciding to invest in our common stock. </B></P> <P STYLE=\"margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B>Neither the SEC nor any state\nsecurities commission has approved or disapproved of these securities or passed upon the accuracy or adequacy of this prospectus supplement or the accompanying prospectus. Any representation to the contrary is a criminal offense.</B> </P>\n<P STYLE=\"font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</P>\n<TABLE CELLSPACING=\"0\" CELLPADDING=\"0\" WIDTH=\"76%\" BORDER=\"0\" STYLE=\"BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt\" ALIGN=\"center\">\n\n\n<TR>\n\n<TD WIDTH=\"78%\"></TD>\n\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\" WIDTH=\"6%\"></TD>\n<TD></TD>\n<TD></TD>\n<TD></TD>\n\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\" WIDTH=\"6%\"></TD>\n<TD></TD>\n<TD></TD>\n<TD></TD></TR>\n<TR STYLE=\"page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:8pt\">\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\">&nbsp;</TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\" COLSPAN=\"2\" ALIGN=\"center\" STYLE=\"border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000\"><B>Per<BR>Share</B></TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\">&nbsp;</TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\" COLSPAN=\"2\" ALIGN=\"center\" STYLE=\"border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000\"><B>Total</B></TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\">&nbsp;</TD></TR>\n\n\n<TR BGCOLOR=\"#cceeff\" STYLE=\"page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt\">\n<TD VALIGN=\"top\"> <P STYLE=\" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\">Public offering price<SUP STYLE=\"font-size:75%; vertical-align:top\">(1)</SUP></P></TD>\n<TD VALIGN=\"bottom\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>\n<TD NOWRAP VALIGN=\"bottom\">$</TD>\n<TD NOWRAP VALIGN=\"bottom\" ALIGN=\"right\">&#8195;&#8195;&nbsp;</TD>\n<TD NOWRAP VALIGN=\"bottom\">&n